## Not covered

**`js/mac-geneva.js`** carries two things that are not this repository's.
`GENEVA9_TTF` is **Geneva 9** by **Kelsey Higham**
(<https://fontstruct.com/fontstructions/show/349277>), as its TrueType
download, unmodified and encoded as base64; it is licensed under the
**Creative Commons Attribution 3.0** licence, and its licence and the readme
FontStruct requires to travel with it are `licences/Geneva9-LICENSE.txt` and
`licences/Geneva9-README.txt`. `GENEVA_METRICS` is the advances and left
bearings of **Kurrajong 9** and **Kurrajong 10**, Copyright (c) 2026 **Ben
Letchford**, licensed under the **SIL Open Font License 1.1** with the
Reserved Font Name "Systemless"; the numbers only, none of Kurrajong's
pixels, and the licence is `licences/Kurrajong-OFL.txt`. A site that copies
the file carries these with it. Geneva itself is Apple's; this is a clone
of the bitmap, and Apple's Geneva is not here.

No game's files are in this repository, and none are needed to run its
check.
